<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Property Perfect starts.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Property Perfect starts.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Caspian Securities said it had started coverage of Thailand's Property Perfect Plc with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- In a Jan 15 report, analyst Mark Stevenson set a 12-month price target of 63 baht per share, representing a nominal baht return of 91 percent and a dollar return of 91 percent.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
